@startuml
!theme mars

title AWSGateKeeper — 冷启动时序图

concise "Lambda 实例" as li
concise "AWS 服务" as aws

@0
li is "初始化"
aws is "空闲"

@1
li is "认证中"
aws is "STS\nGetCallerIdentity"

@2
li is "基础设施\n检查"

@3
li is "就绪"

@4
li is "服务中"

@0
note right
  **main() 启动**
  preference.init()
  → 查找 aws-config.yaml
  → os.Setenv(AWS_*)
end note

@1
note right
  aws.Initialize(ctx)
  → LoadDefaultConfig
  → STS GetCallerIdentity
  耗时: ~200-500ms
end note

@2
note right
  验证 S3 + DynamoDB
  + EventBridge 存在
  耗时: ~500ms-2s
end note

@enduml

@startuml
!theme mars

title AWSGateKeeper — 安全扫描时序 (POST /security/scan)

concise "HTTP" as http
concise "GuardDuty\n扫描" as gd
concise "Inspector\n扫描" as insp
concise "Detective\n调查" as det
concise "报告\n生成" as rpt
concise "投递\nWebhook" as web

@0
http is "请求"
gd is "空闲"
insp is "空闲"
det is "空闲"
rpt is "空闲"
web is "空闲"

@1
http is "处理中"
gd is "ListFindings\n(分页)"
insp is "ListFindings\n(分页)"

@2
http is "处理中"
gd is "GetFindings\n(逐批详情)"
insp is "解析 CVE\n记录元数据"

@3
http is "处理中"
det is "LookupEvents\n(CloudTrail)\n根因分析\n+ 修复建议"

@4
http is "处理中"
rpt is "BuildReport\nMarkdown\n表格 + 摘要"

@5
http is "响应中"
web is "POST JSON\n→ Slack/钉钉/飞书"

@6
http is "200 OK"
web is "已投递"

@1
note right
  **并行阶段 (errgroup)**
  GuardDuty 和 Inspector
  并发运行。
  耗时: ~2-10s 每个
end note

@3
note right
  **逐条顺序执行**
  仅 High+ 级别的发现
  触发 Detective 调查。
  耗时: ~1-5s 每条
end note

@5
note right
  **异步 goroutine**
  S3 + DynamoDB 持久化
  在后台运行。
  HTTP 响应不等待。
end note

@enduml

@startuml
!theme mars

title AWSGateKeeper — 事件响应时序（隔离循环）

concise "EventBridge" as eb
concise "事件\n处理器" as ih
concise "策略\n审计" as audit
concise "威胁\n关联" as threat
concise "隔离\n引擎" as qe
concise "报告\n+ Webhook" as rweb

@0
eb is "空闲"
ih is "空闲"
audit is "空闲"
threat is "空闲"
qe is "空闲"
rweb is "空闲"

@1
eb is "CloudTrail\nIAM 事件"
ih is "解析事件\n提取策略"

@2
ih is "审计中"
audit is "通配符检查\n跨账户检查"

@3
audit is "发现违规"
ih is "关联中"
threat is "GuardDuty\n发现查询"

@4
threat is "评分 ≥ 7.0"
ih is "决策:\n隔离"

@5
ih is "执行中"
qe is "PutUserPolicy\nDeny-*"

@6
qe is "停用\n访问密钥"
ih is "生成报告"

@7
qe is "会话\n已失效"
ih is "报告就绪"
rweb is "POST Webhook\n→ Slack/Teams"

@8
eb is "空闲"
rweb is "已投递"

@3
note right
  **威胁评分 =**
  匹配主体 ARN 的
  GuardDuty 发现
  严重性加权总和。
  0.0 = 正常, 10.0 = 最高风险。
end note

@5
note right
  **隔离触发条件:**
  CRITICAL 违规
  或 威胁评分 ≥ 7.0
end note

@endif
@enduml
